From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deepak1556 <hop2deep@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:22:50 +0900
Subject: [metagen] Relocate explicit macOS SDK paths for temporary GN queries

An explicit mac_sdk_path under the active output directory remains
unchanged when args.gn is copied into the temporary GN query directory.
Chromium's sdk_inputs action then declares outputs outside that
directory, causing gn desc to fail.

On macOS, copy the embedder SDK symlinks into the temporary directory
and rebase mac_sdk_path there. Preserve the existing restoration and
temporary query isolation. Additionally, include GN stdout in failure
diagnostics.

This is a temporary workaround until CL 8499914 replaces the GN query
with action substitutions.

Bug: 531344950
Fixed: 570412918
